    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Measurement boundaries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Exporter/PG18 collection currently verifies sessions, transaction age, configuration and query-ID statistics. Commit/rollback, buffers, locks and WAL delivery panels are not asserted by this lab. There is no configured WAL-G backup here: an absent backup-age signal cannot imply a successful backup."
      }
